{"id":"b404eb64598c2615","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-constructible-order.md","title":"ZFC Constructible Order","display":"df-zfc-constructible-order — ZFC Constructible Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-constructible-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-constructible-order"],"display":"df-zfc-constructible-order — ZFC Constructible Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-constructible-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-constructible-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-constructible-order — ZFC Constructible Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md\">../batch16/58-df-constructible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\theta,&lt;_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\theta,&lt;_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\alpha\\)</span>（可构造层级的集合阶段，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md\">../batch16/58-df-constructible.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>（序数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（集合函数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\)</span>（良序谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstructibleStageOrder}_S(&lt;_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConstructibleStageOrder}_S(&lt;_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\theta)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\\)</span> 为严格良序，参数顺序为关系、载体；不调用自反良序接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstructibleStageOrder}_S(&lt;_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\theta)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,L_\\alpha,\\theta)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L_\\alpha\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(x)\\neq\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(y))\\land\n&lt;_\\alpha=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in L_\\alpha\\times L_\\alpha\\mid\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(x)&lt;\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(y)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(&lt;_\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstructibleStageOrder}_S(&lt;_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\theta)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,L_\\alpha,\\theta)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L_\\alpha\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(x)\\neq\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(y))\\land\n&lt;_\\alpha=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in L_\\alpha\\times L_\\alpha\\mid\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(x)&lt;\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(y)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(&lt;_\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The atom is deliberately stagewise: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> are proper classes, so a set function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(L\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> and the set-level predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}(L,&lt;_L)\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}(L,&lt;_L)\\)</span> would be ill-typed.</li>\n<li>A global definable well-order of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is a class relation assembled coherently from set-sized stages; it is not asserted here as a set-coded object.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_\\alpha$（可构造层级的集合阶段，see [[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$（序数谓词，see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$（集合函数谓词，see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S$（良序谓词，see [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\theta,<_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConstructibleStageOrder}_S(<_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstructibleStageOrder}_S(<_\\alpha,\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\theta)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha,L_\\alpha,\\theta)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L_\\alpha\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(x)\\neq\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(y))\\land\n<_\\alpha=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in L_\\alpha\\times L_\\alpha\\mid\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(x)<\\mathrm{Code}_\\alpha(y)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(<_\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WellOrder}(L,<_L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":2010,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1773","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-constructible-order.md|58-df-zfc-constructible-order]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3743f726a3653802","36d7463d215be751","296e574c4ef84f16","5582a281f15a33c2"]}